<p>Liverpool Sep 132.00 Oct/Dec 136.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Sep 126.00 Oct 128.00 Jan/Mar 134.50 Apr/Jun 137.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon range Sep 109.00/08.50/08.00 Oct/Dec 111.00/10.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Sep 108.00 Oct/Dec 114.00/113.75/13.00</p>
